1339 0 obj
<<
/Title (money is stored in paisa as whole numbers. price, total, amount and every other money column is an integer, so Rs 1,299 is stored as 129900. the column names don't mention paisa, so this rule is where the unit is defined. floats can't represent most decimal amounts exactly and rounding errors pile up over thousands of orders. anything an order depends on is copied at checkout. product name, options, unit price, commission rate and shipping address are copied \(snapshotted\) onto the order. a seller editing a product or a customer editing an address later never changes an order that already happened.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1193 0 R
/Prev 1439 0 R
/Next 1246 0 R
>>
